 as if different gaming eras are colliding. The eerily beautiful/absolutely hideous early-3D cutscenes are particularly inspired, making playing this sometimes feel like platforming your way through a late-nineties PC screensaver that\u2019s having an identity crisis (recommended!).\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815500/ss_d10edfb2d1bc0b5e9836e704f280166fc0e63846.1920x1080.jpg?t=1754935006","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815500/ss_d10edfb2d1bc0b5e9836e704f280166fc0e63846.600x338.jpg?t=1754935006"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815500/ss_5722d956aaca88830c4e8abdb85002714b8b8666.1920x1080.jpg?t=1754935006","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815500/ss_5722d956aaca88830c4e8abdb85002714b8b8666.600x338.jpg?t=1754935006"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815500/ss_f27f1761dfa007c2ad61590707d845909f476dee.1920x1080.jpg?t=1754935006","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815500/ss_f27f1761dfa007c2ad61590707d845909f476dee.600x338.jpg?t=1754935006"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815500/ss_4d8d998460123fc51fbb073c7b73a5554416987c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1754935006","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815500/ss_4d8d998460123fc51fbb073c7b73a5554416987c.600x338.jpg?t=1754935006"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815500/ss_aa610b66aed261531be9b565e26885dfe1f2f8ea.1920x1080.jpg?t=1754935006","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815500/ss_aa610b66aed261531be9b565e26885dfe1f2f8ea.600x338.jpg?t=1754935006"},{"id":5,"path_full